"\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOctober 2026, around autumn time, this is the Florida Broward County Big Flower Postcard.  \n\nHearing news of a dentist visit, everyone has completely different expressions.  \n\nPooh holds the appointment card seriously, while Tigger is just pure excitement. Across the small bridge in the mural, the friends line up and walk together. It's a postcard that brings a smile to both adults and children alike.  \n\n\n\n\n"